{"seq":10,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:28:18.505Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3e54eb8d762e730cf926e435e9d5f3ebc2d9505ba1a7630819c6a13063ec1ff0","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"@Ruth Calloway, here's what Moss's digests show:\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands on **2026-05-04**, when Nadia's industrial account was reassigned in the CRM. The 5/4 digest lists Gideon's ticket #8841 on it, and the 8/3 digest calls it Gideon's biggest account.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. He took over management of it on 2026-05-04 as well.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 9/30 and 12/1 digests both refer to \"Gideon's medical account.\"\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't find a named owner. The digests call it the pod's \"retail\" or \"outdoor\" account and don't say who runs it.\n\nCaveat: the digests use nicknames for accounts, so the link between \"Nadia's industrial account\" and Vantorre Group is my inference from the Allentown plant and ticket #8841. Please confirm the owners in the CRM before the board slide goes out.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
