{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:28:20.757Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"7fc46f8135bc0d2ed8abd6e1527a205632fe0be86f3d9d7b187c3bcabfbb071b","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, I've posted the answer in #strategic-pod. Here it is in brief:\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands on **2026-05-04**, when Nadia's industrial account was reassigned.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato, who took over on the same day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, per the 9/30 and 12/1 digests.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't find a named owner in the digests.\n\nThe digests use nicknames, so I matched \"Nadia's industrial account\" to Vantorre Group by the Allentown plant and ticket #8841. Please confirm the owners in the CRM before the board slide goes out."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
